    thinking: "**Building Admin Panel Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on Part 2: the Admin Panel components. My current focus is on the requirements, starting with a simple login screen. This will feature email/password authentication (mock auth for now), and I\'m planning default credentials for quick testing, such as `admin@jokdelroyal.com` / `admin123`. I will also incorporate a quick log in to streamline the process.\n\n\n**Designing Admin Panel Sidebar**\n\nI\'ve moved on to the sidebar navigation design. I\'m aiming for a dark navy background with white text and icons. The plan includes a logo in the header, navigation items for Dashboard, Forms, Responses/Leads, and Settings. I\'m also planning a user profile section with a logout button at the bottom. A quick toggle for the public form site and mobile responsiveness (drawer/hamburger) are also important.\n\n\n**Developing Form Editing Features**\n\nI\'m now diving into the form editing capabilities. I\'m prioritizing the features to add, reorder, and edit form elements. Key settings include title and description, and choosing field types from short text, long text, email, phone number, dropdown, radio buttons, checkboxes, numbers, and dates. I\'m also planning field labels, placeholders, required flags, and options. A live preview panel is crucial as I build. Finally, I\'m integrating a form duplication feature.\n\n\n**Implementing Response Detail View**\n\nI\'m now implementing the response detail view, envisioning a slide-over or modal showcasing all submitted data. I\'m prioritizing a \"Notes Field\" with author, content, and timestamp history. I\'m also adding a status changer. I\'m including an export button for all responses in a .csv file. The settings section will show company contact info, include a WhatsApp fallback link, email notifications toggle, and a \"Reset/Seed Sample Data\" button. Additionally, I\'m organizing the admin component files.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 866189277
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
