  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Fidelity of the App**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the initial applet compilation was flawless. Now, I\'m meticulously cross-referencing all prompt requirements, starting with the \"Jokdel Royal Web Application\" core branding, to ensure a complete and faithful implementation of the Nigerian real estate focus (sales, letting, management).\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the **Jokdel Royal Form Builder & Simple CRM** web application according to your specifications.\n\n### Summary of Accomplishments\n\n- **Brand Styling & Visual Identity**:\n  - Implemented Jokdel Royal\'s brand palette: **Dark Navy** (`#131B2E`) for headers and primary controls, **Wine/Burgundy** (`#6E1E1E`) for status tags and alert indicators, and **Warm Gold** accents.\n  - Crafted an SVG replica of the Jokdel Royal logo featuring the three dark navy rooflines and wordmark.\n  - Applied Playfair Display serif typography for headings and clean sans-serif typography for forms, tables, and controls.\n\n- **Part 1: Public Form Site**:\n  - **Dynamic Home View**: Displays active inquiry forms rendered dynamically from the admin configuration (Sales, Rentals, Property Management).\n  - **Dynamic Form Renderer**: Supports short text, long text/textarea, email, phone number, dropdown select, radio buttons, checkboxes, number, and date fields with real-time validation.\n  - **Confirmation & WhatsApp Fallback**: Generates reference IDs (e.g. `JOK-2026-8942`), displays a submission summary, and provides a direct WhatsApp link with a pre-filled message referencing the submission.\n\n- **Part 2: Admin Panel & Lightweight CRM**:\n  - **Authentication**: Staff login with a quick one-click demo login option.\n  - **Dark Navy Sidebar Navigation**: Features shortcuts to Dashboard, Forms Manager, Responses/Leads, and Settings.\n  - **Dashboard**: Displays metric summaries (total forms, responses, new leads, conversion rate), pipeline breakdown pills, and a recent submissions feed.\n  - **Form Builder with Live Preview**: Drag/reorder field interface with customizable labels, placeholders, required flags, option lists, form duplication, and a real-time live preview panel.\n  - **Responses / Leads CRM**: Filtering by form, keyword, and status pipeline (*New*, *Contacted*, *In Progress*, *Closed/Converted*, *Not Interested*). Includes a detail view slide-over, staff follow-up note logger, and **CSV Export**.\n  - **Settings**: Controls company contact details, WhatsApp fallback numbers, and includes a sample data reset feature."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 591735749
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
