ounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\'><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\'>Weekly Leads</p><p class=\'text-2xl font-bold mt-1\'>48</p><span class=\'text-green-500 text-[10px] font-bold\'>+12% vs last week</span></div><div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\'><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\'>Conversion Rate</p><p class=\'text-2xl font-bold mt-1\'>18.4%</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\'><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\'>Pending Follow-up</p><p class=\'text-2xl font-bold mt-1 text-wine\'>7</p></div></div><div class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'col-span-2 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex flex-col overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'p-5 border-b border-gray-50 flex items-center justify-between\'><h3 class=\'font-semibold text-sm\'>Recent Responses</h3><a href=\'#\' class=\'text-xs text-navy font-semibold hover:underline\'>View All Leads</a></div><div class=\'flex-1 overflow-auto\'><table class=\'w-full text-left border-collapse\'><thead class=\'bg-gray-50 text-[11px] uppercase text-gray-400 font-bold tracking-wider\'><th class=\'px-6 py-3\'>Submitter</th><th class=\'px-6 py-3\'>Form Name</th><th class=\'px-6 py-3\'>Date</th><th class=\'px-6 py-3\'>Status</th></thead><tbody class=\'text-sm divide-y divide-gray-50\'><tr class=\'hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors\'><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><p class=\'font-medium\'>Adekunle Ciroma</p><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400\'>ade@example.com</p></td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'>Land Sales - Lekki</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4 text-gray-500\'>2h ago</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><span class=\'status-tag bg-wine text-white\'>New</span></td></tr><tr class=\'hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors\'><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><p class=\'font-medium\'>Bisi Akindele</p><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400\'>bisi.a@test.ng</p></td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'>Rental Inquiry - Gbagada</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4 text-gray-500\'>5h ago</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><span class=\'status-tag bg-gray-100 text-gray-500\'>Contacted</span></td></tr><tr class=\'hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors\'><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><p class=\'font-medium\'>Samuel Okon</p><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400\'>s.okon@web.com</p></td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'>Property Mgmt Request</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4 text-gray-500\'>Yesterday</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><span class=\'status-tag bg-blue-50 text-blue-700\'>In Progress</span></td></tr><tr class=\'hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors\'><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><p class=\'font-medium\'>Chioma Eze</p><p class=\'text-xs text-gray-400\'>chioma@me.com</p></td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'>Land Sales - Lekki</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4 text-gray-500\'>Yesterday</td><td class=\'px-6 py-4\'><span class=\'status-tag bg-wine text-white\'>New</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\'col-span-1 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex flex-col p-5 overflow-hidden\'><h3 class=\'font-semibold text-sm mb-4\'>Live Preview: Public Site</h3><div class=\'flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-300 p-4 overflow-y-auto\'><div class=\'max-w-[280px] mx-auto\'><header class=\'text-center mb-6\'><h4 class=\'font-serif text-lg\'>Jokdel Royal</h4><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-500\'>Property Inquiry Form</p></header><div class=\'space-y-4\'><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase\'>Full Name</label><input type=\'text\' placeholder=\'John Doe\' class=\'w-full text-xs p-2 border border-gray-200 rounded outline-none focus:border-navy\'></div><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase\'>Interest</label><select class=\'w-full text-xs p-2 border border-gray-200 rounded\'><option>Land Purchase</option><option>House Rental</option></select></div><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase\'>Message</label><textarea placeholder=\'Tell us more...\' class=\'w-full text-xs p-2 border border-gray-200 rounded h-16 resize-none\'></textarea></div><button class=\'w-full bg-navy text-white text-xs py-2 rounded font-semibold mt-2\'>Submit Inquiry</button></div><p class=\'text-[9px] text-gray-400 text-center mt-6\'>Privacy Policy \342\200\242 Contact Us</p></div></div><div class=\'mt-4 p-3 bg-navy/5 rounded-lg\'><p class=\'text-[11px] font-medium text-navy\'>Admin Tip</p><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\'>Changes made in the Form Builder section will reflect instantly here.</p></div></div></div></div></main></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
