  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing File Uploads**\n\nI\'m now integrating file uploads into `DynamicForm.tsx`, focusing on implementing a file input with base64 conversion. I\'m also adding size validation, with a default limit of 5MB. I\'m also considering a preview box that will show file name, size in MB, and an image preview thumbnail if applicable.\n\n\n**Refining Conditional Rendering**\n\nI\'m now focusing on conditional field rendering. I\'ve implemented logic to check `field.conditionalOn` values against `formValues`, ensuring fields hide when conditions aren\'t met. I\'m also addressing the file input handling by reviewing its logic and enhancing its functionality, and I\'ll revisit the max file size errors. I\'m also planning to render form notice and header notices now.\n\n\n"
